                                "sense_id": "4e69ae40-579e-378a-807f-fadbfc623829",
                                "text": "Among the most injurious of our native weeds are nut grass, spiny aster, western dock, pignut, sunflower, cocklebur, horse nettle and niggerweed; while there are a half score of others nearly if not quite as injurious in special localities."
                            },
