                                "sense_id": "4e69ae40-579e-378a-807f-fadbfc623829",
                                "text": "[…] niggerweed. The plant […] grows rapidly during the heat of late summer on the drier soils over much of the valley and foothill land of California and northward into Oregon […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d3168f4-0a16-4ffb-a155-d05754f59cd7",
                                "sense_id": "4e69ae40-579e-378a-807f-fadbfc623829",
                                "text": "[…] niggerweed or sometimes iron blood. Dig the roots. It makes your iron blood. If you ain't got enough iron blood and get run down, you may have enough of the other blood but no iron blood. Brother, this niggerweed will put it in […]"
